## EXAMPLE OUTPUT

This watchfile tracks advanced semiconductor manufacturing innovations focusing on sub-3nm processes, EUV lithography advancements, and high-NA technology from TSMC, Samsung, and Intel. Priority areas include: gate-all-around transistor implementations, technical performance benchmarks, production capacity expansions, and supply chain resilience strategies. Particular attention to developments since 2023 and projected roadmaps through 2026. Excludes consumer product applications, focusing instead on manufacturing technology, strategic capacity investments, and competitive positioning in leading-edge nodes.
